  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Fleet Vehicle Source has total obligations of $443M in FY2026 to date. Fleet Vehicle Source received 14,792 awards so far in the fiscal year, with an average award size of $30K. Obligations are up 13.3% year over year. Annual obligations have varied: FY21 was $182M, FY22 was $232M, FY23 was $474M, FY24 was $256M, FY25 was $391M, and FY26 is $443M. The current-year total is partial because figures reflect fiscal year to date rather than a full year. Contracting activity shows a spike in FY23 followed by a dip in FY24 and a recovery through FY25 and into FY26. Award volumes and average award size suggest many relatively small awards combined to produce the current obligations total. Procurement teams and suppliers should note the mix of high award counts with moderate average award size when planning staffing and cash flow for federal work with Fleet Vehicle Source.",
